### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:41000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "qwe",
  "password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### inserir veículo
POST http://localhost:41000/insertVeiculo HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "placa": "XYZ9A87",
  "marca": "Toyota",
  "modelo": "Corolla",
  "dono": "Ana Martins"
}

### placa inválida (deve retornar 400 com erros.placa)
POST http://localhost:41000/insertVeiculo HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "placa": "AB12345",
  "marca": "Toyota",
  "modelo": "Corolla",
  "dono": "Ana Martins"
}

### buscar todos os veículos
GET http://localhost:41000/getAllVeiculos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### buscar veículo por ID
GET http://localhost:41000/getVeiculoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### atualizar veículo
PUT http://localhost:41000/updateVeiculo/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "placa": "ABC1D23",
  "marca": "Fiat",
  "modelo": "Argo Drive",
  "dono": "Maria Souza"
}

### excluir veículo cadastrado por engano (soft delete do veículo e dos registros)
DELETE http://localhost:41000/deleteVeiculo/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}